```text
COMMERCIAL LEASE AGREEMENT
THIS AGREEMENT made and entered into this 1st day of February, 2021, by and
between Chad L. Coffelt and Gary Hopkins, hereinafter designated as “Lessor”, and Redwood
Saloon, LLC., hereinafter designated as “Lessee”.
WITNES SETH:
WHEREAS, Lessor will close March 1, 2021 and become the owner of certain real
property located at 2105 East Lincolnway, Cheyenne, Wyoming, consisting of the land and
improvements thereon, described as:
The West 15feet ofLot 10, All ofLots 11 and 12, BlockS, Resubdivision ofLake
Minnehaha, according to the officialplatfiledfor record in the County ofLaramie, State of
Wyoming.
said property having been used as a retail liquor establishment known as the Redwood Lounge
which will continue to operate at that location under this lease, and
WHEREAS, Lessee desires to lease said premises for the purpose of operating said
business and upon approval of the transfer of the Liquor license at the premises to Lessee;
NOW, THEREFORE, for and in consideration of the amount specified as rent and other
good and valuable consideration passing between the parties, the adequacy and receipt of which
is hereby acknowledged and confessed, THE PARTIES AGREE AS FOLLOWS:
1.
Premises. Lessor hereby leases to Lessee the premises known as the Redwood Lounge
described above.
2.
Term of Lease. Lessee shall have possession of premises for a term beginning March 1,
2021 through March 31, 2022. This Lease shall automatically renew for additional one
year terms (12 months) until terminated by either party. Lessee shall have the right to
terminate the lease at any time with sixty (60) days advance written notice.
3.
Rental Amount. Lessee covenants and agrees with the Lessor to pay the Lessor for rental
of the premises during the term of this lease the minimum amount of $4,000.00 per
month which may be paid directly to Lessor or may be disbursed by Lessee directly to
those certain debt obligations owed by Lessors known to the parties. In addition to said
minimum rent, Lessee shall pay to Lessor, as rent and not as wage or salary, an amount
equal to ten percent of gross monthly sales for any month sales from the premises shall
Commercial Lease Agreement
Redwood Saloon, LLC.
Page 1 of5
