### Page 8 of 17

```text
against the leased premises by any governmental entity during the term of this Lease
Agreement. Lessee shall be responsible to pay all personal taxes, employment taxes,
sales and taxes due and/or levied upon the operation of or conduct of business at the
leased premises as well as upon the equipment, furniture, appliance, trade fixtures, and
other personal property of any kind installed or located at the premises.
8.
Trade Fixtures. Any and all improvements made to the leased premises of a permanent
nature prior to the term hereof or during the term hereof shall belong to the Lessor and
shall be deemed leasehold improvements for the purpose of this lease. Fixtures of a
permanent nature shall also be the property of the Lessor. It is understood and agreed that
any furniture, fixtures, equipment, signs and sign standards installed or owned in the
building or otherwise on the leased premises by Lessee, shall remain Lessee’s property
and may be removed by Lessee at any time, whether attached to the building or otherwise
to the leased premises or not; provided, nevertheless, the Lessee shall repair or pay for all
repairs necessary for damages to the premises occasioned by such removal. Lessor shall
be given prior notice and shall be present at the time Lessee removes any furniture,
fixtures, equipment, signs or sign standards installed in or on the leased premises at the
time of removal.
9.
Assignment of Lease. The Lessee will not assign, underlet, sublet or part with possession
of the whole or any part of the leased premises without the prior written consent of the
Lessor.
10. Liens. The Lessee agrees that it shall not and will not suffer or permit a mechanic’s lien
or any other type of lien to attach to or be against or upon the aforesaid premises.
11. Entry and Inspection by Lessor. Lessee shall permit Lessor to enter upon the leased
premises at reasonable times for the purpose of inspecting the same.
12. Hold Harmless.
Lessee, for itself, its agents and assigns, hereby releases, relinquishes
and discharges, and agrees to indemnify, protect and save harmless, the Lessor, their heirs
and assigns, of and including the death of persons or any personal injury or any loss of or
damage to property caused by, growing out of, or happening in connection with Lessee’s
occupancy of the premises.
Commercial Lease Agreement
Redwood Saloon, LLC.
