transfer of the liquor license of Ace Majestic, Inc. DBA Redwood Lounge to Redwood Saloon LLC which
will continue to do business as the Redwood Lounge.
By way of introduction, this is a newly formed LLC the form for the purpose of continuation of the
operation of the Redwood Lounge under new ownership and management. Between myself (Gary
Hopkins) and Chad Coffelt, we have several decades of combined experience in the management and
operation of taverns.
Thank you for your attention to this matter and if you have questions, don’t hesitate to ask.
Redwood Saloon LLC
